OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran conned by AI ex-soldier's
OL,4,A'pity scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA TikTok spokesperson said it had
OL,7,Fstrict rules against "harmfully
OL,8,Fmisleading AI-generated content and
OL,9,Fscams" and that it had removed the
OL,10,Fcontent and accounts shared with them.
